      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also having this issue. \nUnable to select avatar from avatar stands.\nMy avatar does not ever load (I believe I deleted the avatar from my account that was previously in use).\nCannot open Quick Menu\nGoing through portals just locks me in place.\n\nI am still able to walk around and interact with things. I loaded a world through a link and other peoples avatars load fine. Using desktop mode, will test with VR later. \n\nEdit:\nAs mentioned by a user on Discord you can reset to the default avatar by pressing:\n\nCTRL + \\\n\nI was able to open menu and other things after doing this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
